return array('title' => __('BIGSPY AI Theme WP', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
'lead' => __('Build your site with one integrated theme: editable blocks, reusable layouts and a built-in AI workspace.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
'news_version' => '1.96.0',
'news' => array(__('1.96.0: Scrolling text (marquee) becomes a full strip builder: each item can be text, an icon, a logo or a card with its own link and color, in several rows going opposite ways, with item styles, edge fade, tilt, vertical mode, scroll effects and per-device sizes. Floating contact shows the real Zalo mark, lets you pick an icon for each button and adds glossy buttons, card labels, ring waves and a phone-bar shine. The sidebar width can be set for blog, posts, pages, shop and products in px or %, and the editor List View shows an Add to button under each container to insert blocks right there.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.95.0: A new Listing texts panel in Customizer > Layout lets you call your listings Tools, Products, Places or your own word and rewrite every text of the filter bar, cards, listing pages, Sponsored and categories, or turn parts of the filter bar off. Stacking Cards and Flip Box now look the same in the editor as on the site. The affiliate commission line on listings is off by default, and the Customizer search box no longer covers open panels.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.94.0: Blocks keep the same spacing on the published page as in the editor, so stacked blocks no longer touch, and Banners on tablets and phones grow to fit their content instead of cutting it off. Map can load on click, set its height per device and place its info box beside, above or below; Popup opens on a CSS selector, after idle time or at the end of a post, with device, login and date rules, new positions and animations; Nav menu adds dividers, accordions, click-to-open sub-menus and a mobile drawer.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.93.0: Bento Grid tiles can grow with their content, place text at the top, middle or bottom, fill gaps automatically and skip the hover lift. Stacking Cards gain a Simple list layout with no overlap and a soft shadow. A new Footer scroll effect in Customizer > Footer widgets reveals the footer columns one after another, or slides the page away like a curtain to uncover the footer. Existing content looks the same until you change these options.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.92.0: Listing pages get their own sidebar: add widgets or the new Listing sidebar block (Sponsor, Categories, Related resources), or keep the default one. The listing disclosure line can show sponsorship and affiliate notes, only the sponsorship note, or nothing. Social icons add Telegram, Threads, GitHub, Discord, Shopee, Lazada, Google Maps and custom links, with grid or vertical layouts, hover effects and tooltips; Share adds Telegram, Messenger, Print and floating or bottom bars; Payment icons add NAPAS, card and dark styles and your own logos.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.91.0: A new Search block with eight styles, live suggestions, filters and popular keywords, shared with Listing search. Tabs, Accordion, Table, Timeline, Icon List, Heading, Text, Button, Alert, Progress, Counter and more gain many new styles and options, with Ready styles you pick by picture; existing content looks the same. Auto detect can now find empty categories and tags (listing ones too in BIGSPY AI List mode), delete the ones you select and restore them later. Also: quick-edit labels in the Customizer, developer hooks, optional AI abilities (MCP), keyboard focus kept inside popups and the mobile menu, and Flatsome compatibility as a feature switch.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.90.0: Pages load faster: the first large image on every page (a Banner, slider, Zoom hero or the featured image) loads at once with high priority and is preloaded, every image after it is lazy-loaded, and the logo no longer takes that priority. Sponsored cards can rotate through a list of their own: each reload shows the next sponsors until the whole list has been shown. A Banner without an image no longer shows the upload box under its text in the editor, and other plugins\' notices no longer crowd the theme\'s admin pages.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.89.0: The built-in Form can show a price before it is sent: price formulas and per-option prices, a live total with line items, and the server recalculates and saves the quote with the submission. Fields keep stable IDs when renamed or moved, can show or become required depending on other answers, and AI Designer reads and configures forms and price rules with a dry run, a diff and undo.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.88.0: A dedicated Sponsored block with columns, label, description, new tab and full button and card styling; the whole Sponsored card is the link and buttons are soft outlines like the old theme, and Sponsored rows in Listing elements and Listing grid get the same options. Heroes can show a rotating Sponsored by badge, Listing elements ranks Popular by clicks or Site Insights traffic, Heading colors survive Banner and Section text schemes, the Listing search button takes its own colors, border, radius and height, listing pages no longer overflow on phones and can show the author, and Divider gets a Fade line.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.87.0: Section and Banner get animated code backgrounds with no image or video: animated gradient, aurora, floating blobs, moving grid, drifting dots, light rays, particles network, flowing lines and starfield, or your own scoped CSS and animated SVG, with palette colors, speed, density and a mobile switch. Listing elements regains the options of the old BIGSPY AI List block (View more or Load more, slider, blog layouts, category grid styles), Icon List edits each item link from the toolbar, breadcrumbs fall back when the SEO plugin breadcrumb is off, and live search, Map, Lottie and the updater are safer and faster.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.86.0: BIGSPY AI List cards size themselves to the space they sit in: a horizontal card with the logo beside the text when there is room, one column in narrow spots, and Sponsored cards that never get squeezed. Cards get the old theme\'s faint logo watermark, tags and a choice of title and description lines, and Sponsored can sit between rows. Listing blocks look the same in the editor as on the site.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.85.0: Switching from the BIGSPY AI List theme keeps the site looking the same: List mode turns on by itself, the homepage hero, page heroes with a Sponsored tool, the Categories directory, the listings search toolbar and a directory layout for listing pages are read from the old theme settings, each with a switch in Features.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.84.0: BIGSPY AI List listings get the old theme\'s page sections back: a BIGSPY FAQ & FAQ Schema box that also reads the FAQ the Generator wrote in the description, a table of contents with section dividers, Key features, Pros & Cons, Integrations, Related resources and the last updated date, each with its own switch in Features.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__("1.83.0: New BIGSPY AI List mode (Features, off by default) turns WooCommerce products into a directory: listing fields and FAQ, Sponsored slots with one-click AD column, listing, category, search and elements blocks with the old shortcodes, directory patterns and listing cards on shop pages, a homepage sidebar range in the Customizer, and legacy BIGSPY AI List blocks still render. Plugins can add read or content tools to AI Designer.", 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.82.0: New Theme Showcase block introduces the theme with its live version, block count, features and the latest updates from this About page, plus a Get the theme button. Hero images can load first with the new Load priority option in Banner and Image. The free-shipping bar follows every WooCommerce Free shipping rule.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.81.0: AI Designer works faster and smarter: block profiles and 42 ready section recipes with motion, page outline approved once then many sections built per call, SVG/HTML/CSS illustrations, model and specialty pickers in the chat, a fast model for Effort Low, file attachments, per-run time and cost measurements, and context that saves itself and learns what you say applies from now on.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.80.3: Media ATND moves into the media picker: enter a keyword and short description, choose language and model, and press Generate to write alt text, title, caption and description.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.80.2: Horizontal Scroll shows up to three panels on desktop and slides from the fourth, and full-width sections keep their width while pinned.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.80.1: Horizontal Scroll fix: panel width now follows the block width and matches the editor, and the whole section stays on screen while pinned, removing the blank space above and below.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.80.0: Media Library marks used and unused files, and unused files go to a restorable trash after a fresh check. Media ATND writes image alt text, title, caption and description with AI. Horizontal Scroll pins on all screens. AI Designer keeps motion blocks intact when editing.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'), __('1.79.0: Horizontal Scroll adds previous and next buttons with position dots. Infinity Flow keeps moving under reduced motion. Flip Box fills its column.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'), __('1.78.1: Stacking Cards and other sticky motion blocks now work inside a Section. Infinity Flow no longer shows a scrollbar when reduced motion is on.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'), __('1.78.0: AI Designer always builds pages from editable blocks. Moving CF7 forms now covers Form blocks and redirects.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.77.2: Saved SMTP passwords now show as ******** in the Features page.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.77.1: Contact Form 7 migration keeps default options and [wpcf7.*] mail tags. New support links on the About page.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.77.0: Auto detect menu, optional Features page (WebP, SMTP, related links in posts, header and footer code), file uploads and server checks in the built-in form, Contact Form 7 migration, tighter AI Designer output.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.76.0: Motion update: Animated Text, Scroll Story, Stacking Cards, Hover Reveal List, Line Draw, Horizontal Scroll, Zoom Hero, Video Hover Cards, Bento Grid, count-up numbers, motion intensity and style, block previews and colored icons.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.75.0: Products block upgrade and Products list, free-shipping bar and checkout options, block previews, Infinity Flow and Spotlight Panels names, AI Designer fixes.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.74.0: Searchable product guides, setup checklist, sample prompts and shared AI knowledge.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.73.3: Manual GitHub checks refresh the provider cache immediately.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp'),
__('1.73.0: Approval cards, theme knowledge, continuous ticker and expanding gallery.', 'bigspy-ai-theme-wp')),
